      "content": {
        "title": "30,000m² industrial park in Heyuan, Guangdong",
        "sub": null,
        "html": "<section class=\"pp-section pp-section--bg-soft\">\n      <div class=\"pp-container\">\n        <div class=\"pp-section-title pp-text-center\" >\n          <span class=\"pp-eyebrow\">Where we are</span>\n          <h2>30,000m² industrial park in Heyuan, Guangdong</h2>\n          <p  class=\"pp-lead-narrow\">Heyuan is in the northeast of Guangdong, ~200 km from Guangzhou Baiyun International Airport. We can arrange pickup for confirmed visits and one-night hotel accommodation.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pp-grid pp-grid--2\" style=\"margin-top: var(--pp-space-8); gap: var(--pp-space-8); align-items: stretch;\">\n          <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f9ff, #e0f2fe); border-radius: var(--pp-radius-xl); padding: var(--pp-space-6); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 360px;\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 320\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 400px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              \n              <rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"360\" height=\"280\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n              \n              <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n              \n              <path d=\"M 20 200 Q 80 180 140 200 T 260 220 Q 320 240 380 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#60a5fa\" stroke-width=\"3\" opacity=\"0.6\"/>\n              \n              <path d=\"M 80 20 L 80 300\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 2\"/>\n              <path d=\"M 20 120 L 380 120\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 2\"/>\n              <path d=\"M 240 20 L 280 300\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 2\"/>\n              \n              <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"160\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#0d9488\" opacity=\"0.25\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"160\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n              <text x=\"200\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0d9488\" font-weight=\"700\">SHENHE ZHONGKE</text>\n              <text x=\"200\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#64748b\">30,000m² · Heyuan</text>\n              \n              <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"260\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/>\n              <text x=\"100\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#92400e\" font-weight=\"600\">Guangzhou (CAN)</text>\n              \n              <line x1=\"115\" y1=\"255\" x2=\"195\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\" opacity=\"0.6\"/>\n              <text x=\"155\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#92400e\">~200 km</text>\n              \n              <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"285\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"285\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n              <text x=\"80\" y=\"298\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#475569\">50 km</text>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <h3 style=\"color: var(--pp-teal-700); margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-4);\">Visit &amp; logistics</h3>\n            <div class=\"pp-card pp-mb-3\" >\n              <strong  class=\"pp-stack-1\">📍 Factory address</strong>\n              <span  class=\"pp-small-text\">No.141-1 Longteng Road, Gaopugang, Yuancheng District, Heyuan, Guangdong, China</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pp-card pp-mb-3\" >\n              <strong  class=\"pp-stack-1\">✈️ Nearest airport</strong>\n              <span  class=\"pp-small-text\">Guangzhou Baiyun International Airport (CAN) — ~200 km / 2.5h drive</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pp-card pp-mb-3\" >\n              <strong  class=\"pp-stack-1\">🚚 Export port</strong>\n              <span  class=\"pp-small-text\">FOB Guangzhou / Shenzhen — direct loading at the export dock</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pp-card pp-mb-3\" >\n              <strong  class=\"pp-stack-1\">🕐 Working hours</strong>\n              <span  class=\"pp-small-text\">Mon – Fri · 9:00 – 18:00 (GMT+8 / China Standard Time)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"pp-card\" style=\"background: var(--pp-amber-50); border-color: var(--pp-amber-200);\">\n              <strong style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: var(--pp-space-1); color: var(--pp-amber-800);\">💡 Tip</strong>\n              <span  class=\"pp-small-text\">Visiting the park? We arrange pickup from CAN airport and one-night hotel for confirmed visits.</span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"pp-card pp-text-center pp-wa-gate\" data-wa-gate=\"locked\" id=\"wa-gate\">\n              <strong class=\"pp-stack-2\" data-i18n=\"contact.waQr\">WhatsApp QR</strong>\n              <p class=\"pp-small-text pp-mb-3\" data-i18n=\"contact.waQrHint\">Scan with your phone — opens WhatsApp chat with us directly.</p>\n              <div class=\"pp-wa-stage\">\n                <img src=\"//assets/img/whatsapp-qr-shenhe.jpg\n\"                     alt=\"WhatsApp QR code for +86 172 6665 9928\"\n                     width=\"180\" height=\"180\"\n                     style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--pp-ink-200); padding: 8px; background: white;\"\n                     loading=\"lazy\">\n                <p class=\"pp-meta pp-mt-2\">+86 172 6665 9928</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
      }
    },
    {
      "classes": "pp-section pp-section--bg-soft",
      "bg": "soft",
      "type": "prose",
      "content": {
        "title": "Terms, taxes & disputes — clear before you wire",
        "sub": null,
        "html": "<section class=\"pp-section pp-section--bg-soft\">\n      <div class=\"pp-container\">\n        <div class=\"pp-section-title pp-text-center\">\n          <span class=\"pp-eyebrow\" data-i18n=\"trade.eyebrow\">International trade</span>\n          <h2 data-i18n=\"trade.title\">Terms, taxes &amp; disputes — clear before you wire</h2>\n          <p data-i18n=\"trade.subtitle\">B2B export terms, standard across all shipping regions. Anything outside these defaults is negotiable per order. Full policies in our <a href=\"/trade-compliance.html\" class=\"pp-accent-bold\">trade compliance document</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pp-grid pp-grid--2 pp-mt-8\" style=\"gap: var(--pp-space-6);\">\n\n          \n          <div class=\"pp-feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"pp-feature-card__icon pp-feature-card__icon--gradient\">\n              <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/assets/img/icons/sprite.svg#icon-square/\"></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3 data-i18n=\"trade.pricing.title\">Pricing &amp; VAT</h3>\n            <p class=\"pp-prose\" data-i18n-html=\"trade.pricing.body\">All published prices are <strong>EX-Works VAT-exclusive</strong>, <strong>GST-exclusive</strong>, and <strong>import-duty-exclusive</strong>. EU buyers with valid VAT registration self-account via the reverse-charge mechanism (EU VAT Directive Article 196). We provide commercial invoice with HS code + country of origin for your customs declaration.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"pp-feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"pp-feature-card__icon pp-feature-card__icon--gradient\">\n              <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/assets/img/icons/sprite.svg#icon-truck/\"></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3 data-i18n=\"trade.incoterm.title\">Incoterms® 2020</h3>\n            <p class=\"pp-prose\" data-i18n-html=\"trade.incoterm.body\">Default term: <strong>FOB Guangzhou / Shenzhen</strong> per ICC Publication 723E. EXW / FCA / CIF / CFR / DAP / DDP / DPU available on request. Risk transfers at the named port of loading. Quote always specifies which term applies.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"pp-feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"pp-feature-card__icon pp-feature-card__icon--gradient\">\n              <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/assets/img/icons/sprite.svg#icon-briefcase/\"></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3 data-i18n=\"trade.payment.title\">Payment &amp; FX</h3>\n            <p class=\"pp-prose\" data-i18n-html=\"trade.payment.body\"><strong>35% T/T deposit, 65% balance</strong> before shipment (orders &lt; USD 30,000). <strong>L/C at sight</strong> (≥ USD 30,000). Settlement in USD, EUR, or RMB. FX rate locked at invoice date for orders ≥ USD 30,000. Buyer bears FX risk from invoice to deposit receipt; supplier bears risk thereafter.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"pp-feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"pp-feature-card__icon pp-feature-card__icon--gradient\">\n              <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/assets/img/icons/sprite.svg#icon-shield/\"></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3 data-i18n=\"trade.quality.title\">Quality &amp; acceptance</h3>\n            <p class=\"pp-prose\" data-i18n-html=\"trade.quality.body\"><strong>7-day acceptance window</strong> from arrival at destination for visible / packaging defects; <strong>30 days</strong> for active-ingredient / efficacy claims. Discrepancies must be filed with photo evidence and lab report within the window. Verified defects replaced at supplier cost. Returns via FOB Guangzhou back-haul.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"pp-feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"pp-feature-card__icon pp-feature-card__icon--gradient\">\n              <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/assets/img/icons/sprite.svg#icon-clock/\"></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3 data-i18n=\"trade.cancel.title\">Cancellation &amp; refund</h3>\n            <p class=\"pp-prose\" data-i18n-html=\"trade.cancel.body\"><strong>35% deposit non-refundable</strong> after artwork approval. Balance 100% refundable if production has not started (typically 7 days post-deposit). Custom-formula R&amp;D costs are non-refundable once lab work begins. Sample fees: free-SKU shipping paid by buyer, custom-formula samples USD 200-500 non-refundable once lab work begins.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          \n          <div class=\"pp-feature-card\">\n            <div class=\"pp-feature-card__icon pp-feature-card__icon--gradient\">\n              <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/assets/img/icons/sprite.svg#icon-globe/\"></svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3 data-i18n=\"trade.dispute.title\">Dispute resolution</h3>\n            <p class=\"pp-prose\" data-i18n-html=\"trade.dispute.body\">Contracts governed by <strong>the laws of the People's Republic of China</strong>. Disputes resolved via <strong>CIETAC arbitration</strong> in Shanghai (English-language proceedings). ICC Paris or HKIAC available for orders ≥ USD 100,000. Awards enforceable in 170+ jurisdictions under the New York Convention 1958.</p>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pp-mt-8 pp-text-center\">\n          <a href=\"/trade-compliance.html\" class=\"pp-btn pp-btn--ghost pp-btn--lg\" data-i18n=\"trade.cta\">Read full trade compliance document →</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
      }
    },
    {
      "classes": "pp-section",
      "bg": "plain",
      "type": "prose",
      "content": {
        "title": "Common questions before your first RFQ",
        "sub": null,
        "html": "<section class=\"pp-section\">\n      <div class=\"pp-container\">\n        <div class=\"pp-section-title pp-text-center\" >\n          <span class=\"pp-eyebrow\">FAQ</span>\n          <h2>Common questions before your first RFQ</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pp-grid pp-grid--2\" style=\"margin-top: var(--pp-space-8); gap: var(--pp-space-4);\">\n          <div class=\"pp-card\">\n            <h3  class=\"pp-card-title\">What's your typical MOQ?</h3>\n            <p  class=\"pp-prose-tight\">ODM (our formula + your label) starts at <strong>1,000 sets per SKU</strong>. OEM (your formula) is typically 1,000–3,000 bottles depending on formula complexity and packaging. Trial orders below MOQ are negotiable for established partners.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pp-card\">\n            <h3  class=\"pp-card-title\">How long does production take?</h3>\n            <p  class=\"pp-prose-tight\">ODM orders: <strong>25–40 days</strong> after deposit and label approval. OEM orders: <strong>30–45 days</strong> for formula + sample, plus 25–40 days for first production batch. Both are documented in the RFQ response.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pp-card\">\n            <h3  class=\"pp-card-title\">Can I get samples, and what do they cost?</h3>\n            <p  class=\"pp-prose-tight\">Yes. Samples of any of our <strong>20 existing SKUs</strong> can be ordered — the sample fee is confirmed in the quotation together with the specification, and shipping is paid by the customer. Custom formula samples are charged as well and require 7–14 days for lab production.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pp-card\">\n            <h3  class=\"pp-card-title\">What payment terms do you accept?</h3>\n            <p  class=\"pp-prose-tight\"><strong>35% T/T deposit, 65% balance</strong> before shipment for orders under USD 30,000. L/C at sight for orders ≥ USD 30,000. We invoice in USD, EUR, and RMB. FX rate locked at invoice date for orders ≥ USD 30,000. See <a href=\"#trade-terms\"  class=\"pp-accent-bold\">Trade Terms section</a> above.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pp-card\">\n            <h3  class=\"pp-card-title\">Do you provide MSDS and compliance docs?</h3>\n            <p  class=\"pp-prose-tight\">Yes — MSDS for every SKU, FDA registration confirmation, ISO 22716 GMP certificate, third-party lab reports, product liability insurance (USD 1M / USD 5M aggregate), CPSR (EU Regulation 1223/2009), and REACH SVHC declarations. See the <a href=\"/capabilities.html\"  class=\"pp-accent-bold\">R&amp;D / Documentation section</a>.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pp-card\">\n            <h3  class=\"pp-card-title\">Who pays import duties and VAT?</h3>\n            <p  class=\"pp-prose-tight\">Buyer (importer of record) pays all destination-country taxes, VAT/GST, and import duties. Our published prices are EX-Works VAT-exclusive. EU buyers with VAT registration self-account via reverse charge. We provide commercial invoice with HS code for your customs declaration. See <a href=\"#trade-terms\"  class=\"pp-accent-bold\">Trade Terms section</a> above.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pp-card\">\n            <h3  class=\"pp-card-title\">Which law governs the contract and where are disputes resolved?</h3>\n            <p  class=\"pp-prose-tight\">All contracts governed by <strong>the laws of the People's Republic of China</strong>. Disputes resolved via <strong>CIETAC arbitration</strong> in Shanghai (English-language). Awards enforceable in 170+ jurisdictions under the New York Convention 1958.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pp-card\">\n            <h3  class=\"pp-card-title\">What's your refund policy?</h3>\n            <p  class=\"pp-prose-tight\"><strong>35% T/T deposit non-refundable</strong> after artwork approval. Balance 100% refundable if production has not started (typically 7 days post-deposit). Custom-formula R&amp;D costs are non-refundable once lab work begins. Verified defects replaced at supplier cost.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pp-card\">\n            <h3  class=\"pp-card-title\">How quickly will I be notified after submitting the form?</h3>\n            <p  class=\"pp-prose-tight\">Your enquiry reaches the sales desk the moment you send it, and a named sales manager works it. You will hear back within one business day, on the channel you wrote from. If you want to check on it in the meantime, keep the enquiry reference we give you and ask for it on WhatsApp or by email.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pp-card\">\n            <h3  class=\"pp-card-title\">Can I visit the factory?</h3>\n            <p style=\"color: var(--pp-ink-700); font-size: var(--pp-text-sm); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;\">Absolutely. <a href=\"/factory.html\"  class=\"pp-accent-bold\">See the Factory Tour page</a> for the typical 2-day visit flow, or <a href=\"/contact.html?topic=audit\"  class=\"pp-accent-bold\">request a video audit</a> if you can't travel.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
      }
    },
