        "html": "<noscript><iframe src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-5KV9GJR2\"\nheight=\"0\" width=\"0\" style=\"display:none;visibility:hidden\"></iframe></noscript>\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main id=\"main\">\n\n     \n\n     \n\n    \n     \n\n    \n     \n\n    \n     \n\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n<div id=\"cf-success-modal\" class=\"cf-success-modal\" hidden role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"cf-success-title\">\n  <div class=\"cf-success-modal__overlay\" onclick=\"cfSuccessClose()\"></div>\n  <div class=\"cf-success-modal__panel\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"cf-success-modal__close\" onclick=\"cfSuccessClose()\" aria-label=\"Close\">×</button>\n    <div class=\"cf-success-mark\">✅</div>\n    <h2 id=\"cf-success-title\">Inquiry submitted</h2>\n    <div class=\"cf-ref\" id=\"cf-success-ref\">📋 Reference: —</div>\n    <p class=\"cf-tagline\" id=\"cf-success-tagline\"></p>\n    \n    <div class=\"pz-gmail-tip\">📬 <strong>Gmail users:</strong> our reply email may land in your <strong>Promotions</strong>, <strong>Updates</strong>, <strong>Spam</strong>, or <strong>Social</strong> tab instead of Inbox. Drag this email to <strong>Primary</strong> and add <code>sales@shenhezhongke.com</code> to your contacts to ensure delivery.</div>\n\n    <div id=\"cf-success-regblock\" class=\"cf-regcard\" hidden>\n      <h3>🔑 Your customer portal account</h3>\n      <div class=\"row\"><strong>📧 Email</strong><span id=\"cf-success-email\">—</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><strong>🔑 Temporary password</strong><span>Emailed to you (12 chars)</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><strong>🪪 Magic link</strong><span>24-hour, one-time use</span></div>\n      <a id=\"cf-success-magic\" class=\"magic\" href=\"#\">📨 Set my password now →</a>\n      <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:12px; color:#9a3412;\">\n        💡 We also sent a welcome email with both the temp password and the magic link — check your inbox.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"cf-success-existingblock\" hidden style=\"background:#ecfeff;border:1px solid #67e8f9;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:18px;color:#155e75;font-size:14px;\">\n      <strong>🔗 Your account is already active.</strong> Sign in to view this inquiry and message our team.\n      <p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;\"><a href=\"/portal/login.html?next=dashboard.html\" style=\"color:#0d9488;font-weight:600;\">Open customer portal →</a></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <form id=\"cf-success-prefs\" class=\"cf-prefs\" onsubmit=\"cfPrefsSubmit(event)\">\n      <h3>📋 Help us serve you better <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:500;\">(optional)</span></h3>\n      <p>Takes 10 seconds. Helps us reply faster and tailor samples.</p>\n      <div class=\"row2\">\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label>Preferred contact method</label>\n          <select name=\"preferred_contact\">\n            <option value=\"\">No preference</option>\n            <option value=\"email\">Email</option>\n            <option value=\"whatsapp\">WhatsApp</option>\n            <option value=\"phone\">Phone call</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label>Your role</label>\n          <select name=\"business_role\">\n            <option value=\"\">Select...</option>\n            <option>Buyer / Procurement</option>\n            <option>Founder / CEO</option>\n            <option>Sales / BD</option>\n            <option>Brand / Marketing</option>\n            <option>Product / R&amp;D</option>\n            <option>Designer / Formulator</option>\n            <option>Other</option>\n          </select>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label>How did you hear about us?</label>\n        <select name=\"referral_source\">\n          <option value=\"\">Select...</option>\n          <option>Google search</option>\n          <option>Alibaba / Made-in-China</option>\n          <option>LinkedIn</option>\n          <option>Industry trade show</option>\n          <option>Referral / word of mouth</option>\n          <option>Industry publication / blog</option>\n          <option>Other</option>\n        </select>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label>Anything else? (target launch date, certifications needed, etc.)</label>\n        <textarea name=\"notes\" maxlength=\"2000\" placeholder=\"Optional — anything that helps us serve you better.\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n      <button type=\"submit\" id=\"cf-success-submit\" class=\"pz-btn pz-btn--primary\" style=\"width:100%;background:#0d9488;color:white;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;border:0;cursor:pointer;\">✓ Complete registration</button>\n      <div id=\"cf-success-prefmsg\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\"></div>\n    </form>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <a href=\"/portal/dashboard.html\" class=\"pz-btn--primary\">Go to my portal →</a>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"ghost\" onclick=\"cfSuccessClose()\">Stay on this page</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
